@baseUrl = http://localhost:49918

### Gate collection statistics for today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gate/stats
Accept: application/json

### Gate collection statistics for a specific day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gate/stats?date=2026-11-15
Accept: application/json

### Record a gate scan using the reader-provided timestamp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gate/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "TagID": "RFID-1001",
  "Timestamp": "2026-11-15T21:18:00+05:30",
  "GateId": "MAIN-GATE",
  "Source": "Auto"
}

### Unknown tag returns 404 and is audited
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gate/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "TagID": "UNKNOWN-TAG",
  "Timestamp": "2026-11-15T21:19:00+05:30",
  "GateId": "MAIN-GATE",
  "Source": "Auto"
}
